        "text": "All dogs should avoid chocolate, grapes, raisins, onions, garlic, xylitol (artificial sweetener), alcohol, and macadamia nuts — these are toxic. For seniors specifically, high-sodium foods can worsen heart disease, high-phosphorus diets can accelerate kidney decline, and high-fat foods can trigger pancreatitis. Always confirm treats are safe and low in sodium and phosphorus for senior dogs."
